aiHealth Imaging
================

This product includes third-party software:

- three.js (MIT License) — https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js
- three-mesh-bvh (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019 Garrett Johnson) — https://github.com/gkjohnson/three-mesh-bvh
  Used by the IOS workbench for raycasting and closest-point queries.

Algorithms in src/workbench/core are written for this project from the published methods:
- Horn (1987), closed-form absolute orientation with unit quaternions (landmark alignment)
- Chen & Medioni (1992), point-to-plane ICP
- Garland & Heckbert (1997), quadric error metric simplification
- Taubin (1995), lambda|mu smoothing

No code from OccluTrace/OccluView (Apache-2.0) or from any GPL/AGPL project is included.
manifold-3d (Apache-2.0) is not used in this version.
